  <DMS_Tab.label>失能機關</DMS_Tab.label>
  <!-- EN: Nara Industries is made up of countless colonial fleets that travel endlessly between star systems developing new worlds; nobody knows what motivates them. Their colonial fleets tend to spread technology to every living world they moor at, justified as the advancement of human civilization, forcing the local population to complete the selection process of the Great Filter amid the turbulence of that progress, and to complete it fast. -->
  <DMS_Tab.generalDescription>奈良重工是由無數支在星系之間不斷進行星際旅行與星球開發的殖民船隊所組成，沒有人知道他們這麼做的動機。但他們的殖民艦隊往往會以提升人類文明的理由將科技與技術傳播到他們所停泊的每一顆生命星球，迫使當地居民在短時間內不得不在技術進步的動蕩中完成大過濾器的選擇過程。</DMS_Tab.generalDescription>
  <!-- EN: Nara Industries Engineering -->
  <DMS_Tab.generalTitle>奈良重工工程</DMS_Tab.generalTitle>

